&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avionics Manufacturing Engineer II: 120,000 - $170,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Avionics Manufacturing Engineer: $140,000 - $205,000&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
