&lt;li&gt;Experience with software programming: Matlab, Python, C/C++, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with vehicle and instrumentation buses such as Ethernet, CAN, SPI, and I2C, as well as serial I/O (RS232/422/485)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with full-lifecycle product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with designing electronics for spaceflight environments, verifying workmanship and operability through environmental tests (random vibration, shock, thermal, burn-in, and TVAC)&lt;/li&gt;
