&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and operate multi-axis CNC Mills/Lathes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read and interpret setup sheets and tool lists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to check parts that are running according to the in-process inspection plan, including optical comparator, caliper, and micrometers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand speeds and feeds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate with machine shop leadership when parts exhibit quality issues or concern&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform first article inspections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deburr all parts to ensure quality part&lt;/li&gt;
