&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of CNC machining experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years working with CNC machines with HAAS and Fanuc controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalent work experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of GD&amp;amp;T&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of G code&lt;/li&gt;
