&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain a data acquisition and controls stack to support a wide range of partnering test teams at the Long Beach site—creating software tools and setting standards for test assets and practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, and own complex control systems for testing space-rated hardware, with responsibility for both hardware and software components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across disciplines—including software, thermal, manufacturing, propulsion, ECLSS, and mechanical test teams—to drive robust testing practices, gather upgrade requests, and define new capabilities for the test stack.&lt;/li&gt;
