&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in hardware assembly, test, and/or installation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the aerospace industry, aviation, military, or other high-reliability operating environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the assembly and testing of propulsion systems, avionics components, and harnesses&lt;/li&gt;
