&lt;li&gt;Experience handling tickets in a service desk&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience with ITSM tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and ability to work independently and collaboratively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exhibits excellent cross collaboration communication and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to resolve difficult technical issues with limited information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a manufacturing/aerospace environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience handling tickets in a service desk but preferred in Jira Service Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting enterprise applications such as Netsuite, Manufacturo, NX/Teamcenter, engineering systems&lt;/li&gt;
