&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Support&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and execution of Vast’s government affairs strategy focused on national security space, including engagement with Congress and USG agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across Legal, Programs, Engineering, Business Development, and executive leadership to align advocacy efforts with mission and programmatic priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Congressional &amp;amp; USG Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships with relevant Congressional offices, committees, and staff, particularly those overseeing defense, space, authorization, and appropriations matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Vast’s Business Development engagement with USG agencies and the executive branch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate briefing materials, meeting preparation, follow-ups, and stakeholder tracking for congressional and agency engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Policy and Advocacy&lt;/strong&gt;
