&lt;li&gt;Prepare policy briefs, talking points, legislative summaries, and advocacy materials for internal and external use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support written submissions for defense-related RFIs, trade reports, industry engagements, and legislative opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
