&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program and Partnership Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Business Development to support DoD-related contracting opportunities, cooperative agreements, and strategic partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify national security needs where Vast’s commercial capabilities can support resilience, mission assurance, space domain awareness, and broader defense space objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide policy support for defense-related technology initiatives, security reviews, and regulatory engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
