&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or around the Pentagon, U.S. Space Force, or other national security stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current registered lobbyist or willingness and ability to register as a lobbyist, as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of congressional processes, including authorization, appropriations, and the NDAA.&lt;/li&gt;
