&lt;li&gt;Experience with government contracting or government procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationships with relevant armed services, defense appropriations, space, and national security offices or committees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to simplify complex concepts into straightforward and concise explanations.&lt;/li&gt;
