&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with applicable laws and payroll tax obligations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate timekeeping and payroll systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;System maintenance support including new hire set up, tax form processing, local tax set up, timekeeping input, termination processing, garnishment processing, and verification of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Human Resources (HR) and accounting teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee processing of payroll changes (e.g. new hires, terminations, raises) and system upgrades&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage workflow to ensure all payroll transactions are processed accurately and timely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand state and federal new hire, leave of absence, and termination laws&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce audit reports, audit registers, and other reporting inquiries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve issues and answer payroll-related questions&lt;/li&gt;
