&lt;li&gt;In-depth understanding of payroll procedures, laws, taxes, and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with payroll software/ HRIS (e.g. Rippling) and MS Office&lt;/li&gt;
