&lt;li&gt;Excellent attention to detail, accuracy, time management and work prioritization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and with a team in a fast-paced, high-volume environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensures confidentiality and controls access to sensitive information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of accountability and integrity with excellent written and verbal communication skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
