&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in electrical engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 years of experience in developing power electronics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to creatively solve problems and bring multiple disciplines together while assessing risk and making design and development decisions with incomplete data set.&lt;/li&gt;
