&lt;li&gt;Issue and manage visitor and temporary employee badges, ensuring only authorized individuals enter designated areas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct routine patrols of all buildings, perimeter areas, and critical infrastructure to detect and deter unauthorized activity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Observe, document, and report any suspicious behavior, security violations, or safety concerns to security management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escort vendors and contractors as required, ensuring compliance with facility security protocols.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide security assistance to other departments as needed, including support for special events or operational activities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate and detailed incident reports, shift logs, and security documentation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond professionally to security-related inquiries, safety concerns, and emergency situations in accordance with company policies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
