&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valid California BSIS Guard Card or ability to obtain before employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two or more years of experience in security operations, preferably in an industrial, aerospace, or manufacturing environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
