&lt;li&gt;Ability to de-escalate situations verbally and maintain composure under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior BSIS or equivalent security training, such as de-escalation tactics, report writing, or defensive tactics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to provide clear and concise incident reports.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently while following security procedures and protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be available to work all required shifts, including overtime, weekends, and holidays, based on operational needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to stand, walk, and conduct patrols for extended periods across various terrains.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
