&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weekday Shifts:&lt;/strong&gt; Monday–Friday: 7am–3:30pm and/or&amp;nbsp; 11pm–7:30am&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Access Control &amp;amp; Credentialing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify identity and authorization for visitors, contractors, and employees, including handling escalated or unusual access matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Issue and manage visitor and temporary credentials and help ensure compliance with facility access procedures across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in identifying discrepancies or anomalies in access activity and reporting them appropriately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
