&lt;li&gt;Apply effective communication and de-escalation skills in tense or uncertain situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain organized, accurate daily logs, reports, and security documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;General&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
