&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Five or more years&lt;/strong&gt; of experience in security operations, preferably in aerospace, industrial, or similarly technical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven proficiency in incident response, report writing, and enforcing security standards with limited supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
