&lt;p&gt;This will be a full-time,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;exempt&lt;/strong&gt; position located in our &lt;strong&gt;Long Beach&lt;/strong&gt; location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop category specific strategies for the machining supply base to deliver high quality and low cost solutions for Vast Engineering and Manufacturing Customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of machining processes, including CNC milling, CNC turning, multi-axis machining, complex assemblies, special processes, and inspection requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience sourcing tight-tolerance, low-volume/high-mix, prototype, development, or production machined hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret engineering drawings, CAD models, and technical specifications to ensure suppliers have the necessary capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-End Commodity Management: Manage assigned commodities from demand to contract fulfillment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Tactical Execution: Apply sourcing and supplier management expertise across all organizational levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supply Base Development: Optimize the supply base to meet long-term program needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cost and Risk Reduction Strategy: Develop strategies to reduce total cost, lead time, and supply chain risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplier Research &amp;amp; Negotiation: Conduct market research, assess suppliers, issue RFQs/RFPs, and lead contract negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrated Sourcing Strategy: Align sourcing with program, customer, product lifecycle, and in-service support strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplier Performance Management: Oversee supply/demand planning, schedule adherence, quality, on-time delivery, and cost for suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplier Development &amp;amp; Improvement: Lead supplier improvement initiatives and integrate results into strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Value Engineering &amp;amp; Cost Analysis: Drive value engineering, BOM cost breakdowns, and should-cost analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek alternate and innovative ideas to provide business solutions, challenge requirements and specifications to create competitive advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
