&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 years in a Procurement role, 3 years in aerospace industry and/or manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor of Science degree in Business, Engineering or Business-related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to create and update request for proposals (RFPs), purchase orders (POs) and facilities work orders in an enterprise resource planning (ERP) software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively in a team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to make independent judgments with limited information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication skills for relaying data (verbally and in-writing) between other employees, vendors, and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a high-stress environment balancing several projects at any given time, and the flexibility to adjust for abrupt changes in strategic direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance multiple priorities with ambiguous instructions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
