&lt;li&gt;Day to day management of various contractors&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform job walk-downs with vendors, engineers, supervisors, and managers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track all work in the Facilities CMMS system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate forklifts, scissor lifts, and boom lifts when needed&lt;/li&gt;
