&lt;li&gt;4+ years of facilities and/or maintenance experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with facilities within an aerospace industry&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in construction, project management, equipment maintenance, and tenant improvements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of electrical, plumbing, heating, ventilation, air&amp;nbsp; conditioning and refrigeration (HVAC/R), concrete, framing, and industrial gas trade&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of basic engineering and construction principles and methods&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
