&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8-10 years of experience in partnerships, business development, or related commercial fields&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience managing brand partnerships end-to-end, including rights management, campaigns and activation, and performance evaluation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen; comfortable building partnership proposals, rights frameworks and pricing benchmarks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent project management skills with the ability to manage multiple partners, projects and timelines simultaneously&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex or technical concepts into clear, compelling commercial narratives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional relationship-building and stakeholder management skills with internal and external partners&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
