&lt;li&gt;Mastery of advanced reliability and quality tools (RCA, FMEA, SPC, control plans); Six Sigma Black Belt or equivalent experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical depth in avionics design, manufacturing, integration, and/or test&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
