&lt;li&gt;Experience leading design reviews (PDR, CDR) and verification campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-disciplinary communication and technical leadership skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems-level intuition and the ability to create, own and drive systems engineering processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background with spacecraft, aircraft, launch vehicles, or other mission- or safety-critical systems&lt;/li&gt;
