&lt;li&gt;Software Engineering Skills (C++, Golang, Javascript, React, Matlab, Python/Octave, Software Architecture, Databases, Cloud).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient at using command line interfaces and scripting languages associated with spaceflight ground systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
