&lt;li&gt;Own the lifecycle of software, including rolling out to operations, managing configurations, maintaining and upgrading, and supporting end-users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and optimize automated testing and deployment systems&lt;/li&gt;
