&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in full life cycle technical/engineering recruiting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with our ATS, Greenhouse.&lt;/li&gt;
